{"label_alt_en":["Draft scheme of the Committee : procedure: Arts. 12/15","procedure: Arts. 12/15"],"label_alt_fr":["Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction : procedure: Arts. 12/15","procedure: Arts. 12/15"],"broader":[{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.procedure-of-the-court","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Procédure de la Cour","pref_en":"Procedure of the Court","is_facet":null}],"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","issues":[],"pages":[600,651,666],"pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, articles 12–15","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, articles 12 à 15","printed":["t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.procedure-arts-12-15"],"related":[],"label_scope_note_en":"The Committee considered articles 12 to 15 of the procedure section of the drafting committee's scheme.","type":"concept","direct_count":77,"propagated_count":77,"breadcrumb_paths":[[{"id":"facet.committee","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Travaux du Comité","pref_en":"The Committee's own work","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, articles 12 à 15","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, articles 12–15","is_facet":null}],[{"id":"facet.nature","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Nature et établissement de la Cour","pref_en":"Nature & establishment of the Court","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme","type":"plan","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, articles 12 à 15","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, articles 12–15","is_facet":null}],[{"id":"facet.procedure","type":"theme","pref_fr":"Procédure","pref_en":"Procedure","is_facet":true},{"id":"c.procedure-of-the-court","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Procédure de la Cour","pref_en":"Procedure of the Court","is_facet":null},{"id":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","type":"concept","pref_fr":"Avant-projet du Comité de rédaction : procédure, articles 12 à 15","pref_en":"Drafting Committee draft scheme: procedure, articles 12–15","is_facet":null}]],"narrower":[],"printed_entries":[{"entries":[{"article_ref":{"art":"12","part":"procedure","range":[12,15]},"label_heading":"Avant-projet soumis par le Comité de rédaction","id":"fr.0027.33","lang":"fr","qualifier":null,"raw":"Arts. 12/15 — 590, 641, 656 (15).","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":600,"printed":590,"raw":"590","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":651,"printed":641,"raw":"641","seq":false},{"art_qual":"15","flags":[],"pdf":666,"printed":656,"raw":"656 (15)","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":776,"sub":"procedure: Arts. 12/15"},{"article_ref":{"art":"12","part":"procedure","range":[12,15]},"label_heading":"Draft scheme of the Committee","id":"en.0075.33","lang":"en","qualifier":null,"raw":"Arts. 12/15 — 590, 641, 656 (15).","refs":[{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":600,"printed":590,"raw":"590","seq":false},{"art_qual":null,"flags":[],"pdf":651,"printed":641,"raw":"641","seq":false},{"art_qual":"15","flags":[],"pdf":666,"printed":656,"raw":"656 (15)","seq":false}],"see":[],"source_pdf":783,"sub":"procedure: Arts. 12/15"}],"id":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction.procedure-arts-12-15","label_en":"procedure: Arts. 12/15","label_fr":"procedure: Arts. 12/15","n_pages":3,"pages":[600,651,666],"parent":"t.avant-projet-soumis-par-le-comite-de-redaction","printed_en_id":"en.0075.33","printed_fr_id":"fr.0027.33","see":[],"type":"article"}],"groups":[{"meeting":25,"section":"25","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0579.07","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":579,"printed":569,"texts":{"fr":"Au cours des débats, les juges posent aux témoins, agents, experts, avocats ou conseils, toutes questions qu'ils estiment utiles; les agents, avocats et conseils ont le droit de poser, par l'entremise du Président, toute question que la Cour juge utile.","en":"During the hearing in Court, the judges may put any questions, considered by them to be necessary, to the witnesses, agents, experts, advocates or Counsels. The agents, advocates and Counsels shall have the right to ask, through the President, any questions that the Court considers useful.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","weight":1.0,"end":128,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4566,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0579.09","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":579,"printed":569,"texts":{"fr":"La Cour rend des ordonnances pour la direction du procès, la détermination des formes et délais dans lesquels chaque partie doit finalement conclure, et prend toutes les mesures que comporte l'administration des preuves.","en":"The Court shall make orders for the conduct of the case, shall decide the form and time in which each party must conclude its arguments, and make all arrangements connected with the taking of evidence.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","weight":1.0,"end":95,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4567,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0579.11","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":579,"printed":569,"texts":{"fr":"Après avoir reçu les preuves et témoignages dans les délais déterminés par elle, la Cour peut écarter toutes dépositions ou documents nouveaux qu'une des parties voudrait lui présenter sans l'assentiment de l'autre.","en":"After the Court has received the proofs and evidence within the time specified for the purpose, it may refuse to accept any further oral or written evidence that one party may desire to present, unless the other agrees.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","weight":1.0,"end":184,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4568,"start":81}]},{"seg_id":"s0579.13","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":579,"printed":569,"texts":{"fr":"Lorsqu'une des parties ne se présente pas, ou s'abstient de faire valoir ses moyens, l'autre partie peut demander à la Cour de lui adjuger ses conclusions.","en":"Whenever one of the parties shall not appear before the Court or shall fail to defend his case, the other party may call upon the Court to decide in favour of his claim.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","weight":1.0,"end":155,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4570,"start":85}]},{"seg_id":"s0579.14","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":579,"printed":569,"texts":{"fr":"La Cour y fait droit, après s'être assurée que ces conclusions:","en":"The Court shall do so provided that it is satisfied that the claim is:","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","weight":1.0,"end":63,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4572,"start":0}]},{"seg_id":"s0579.15","meeting":25,"doc":"annex","pdf":579,"printed":569,"texts":{"fr":"1. sont conformes à la matérialité des faits; 2. reposent sur des preuves sérieuses; 3. sont fondées en droit.","en":"1. in conformity with the actual facts; 2. supported by substantial evidence; 3. well founded in law.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","weight":1.0,"end":110,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4574,"start":49}]}]},{"meeting":28,"section":"28","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0600.01","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"LORD PHILLIMORE veut ajouter le mot „bureaux”.","en":"LORD PHILLIMORE wished to add the word “bureaux.”","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.01","speaker_id":"phillimore","certain":true,"name":"Lord Phillimore","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.02","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Sur la proposition de M. DE LAPRADELLE l'insertion de la formule „corps, bureaux, commissions ou organes” est adoptée.","en":"On M. DE LAPRADELLE's proposal, the expression “bodies, bureaux, commissions or organisations” was adopted.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.02","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.03","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"L'article ainsi modifié est adopté.","en":"The Article was adopted with this modification.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.03","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.04","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Article 12.","en":"Article 12.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.05","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est adopté avec des modifications de rédaction.","en":"This Article was adopted with modifications in wording.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.05","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.06","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Article 13.","en":"Article 13.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.07","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est adopté sans discussion.","en":"This Article was adopted without discussion.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.07","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.08","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Article 14.","en":"Article 14.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.09","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est adopté sans discussion.","en":"This Article was adopted without discussion.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.09","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.10","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Article 15.","en":"Article 15.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.11","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"M. HAGERUP fait valoir que l'hypothèse du no. 1 est l'une de celles qui sont visées par le no. 2; le no. 1 devrait par conséquent, être supprimé. On reconnaît le bien-fondé de cette observation.","en":"M. HAGERUP pointed out that the hypothesis contained in number 1, was covered by number 2; therefore, number 1 should be eliminated. The justice of this contention was admitted.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.11","speaker_id":"hagerup","certain":true,"name":"Francis Hagerup","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.12","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Le PRESIDENT propose la formule suivante, destinée à remplacer l'alinéa 2:","en":"The PRESIDENT proposed the following wording, to replace Paragraph 2:","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.12","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.13","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"„La Cour a toute liberté pour les accueillir après s'être assurée que ces conclusions sont suffisamment fondées en fait et en droit.”","en":"“The Court shall be free to decide accordingly, provided that it has satisfied itself, that the claim is well-founded in fact and law.”","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.13","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.14","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"M. DE LAPRADELLE appuie la suppression du no. 1.","en":"M. DE LAPRADELLE supported the deletion of Number 1.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.14","speaker_id":"lapradelle","certain":true,"name":"Albert de Geouffre de Lapradelle","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.15","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"LORD PHILLIMORE propose une formule de transaction qui est amendée par M. de Lapradelle de la façon suivante: „La Cour fait droit à la condition de s'être assurée que ces conclusions, reposant sur des preuves sérieuses, sont fondées en fait et en droit.”","en":"LORD PHILLIMORE proposed a compromises which was amended by M. de Lapradelle at follows: “The Court shall do so provided that it is satisfied that the claim is supported by conclusive evidence and well-founded in fact and law.”","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.15","speaker_id":"phillimore","certain":true,"name":"Lord Phillimore","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.16","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"M. RICCI-BUSATTI fait valoir que l'article est parfaitement inutile si les pouvoirs de la Cour restent absolument les mêmes lorsqu'il s'agit de rendre un jugement par défaut. Une disposition expresse à ce sujet ne se justifierait que si l'on avait l'intention de limiter ces pouvoirs dans l'intérêt…","en":"M. RICCI-BUSATTI pointed out that the Article was quite useless if the powers of the Court were to be exactly the same even in case of judgment by default. The inclusion of a special provision on this point would be justified only if the intention were to limit these powers in the interests of the…","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.16","speaker_id":"ricci-busatti","certain":true,"name":"Arturo Ricci-Busatti","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]},{"seg_id":"s0600.17","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":600,"printed":590,"texts":{"fr":"Mr. ROOT maintient, premièrement, la nécessité des jugements par contumace, et, deuxièmement, la nécessité que ces jugements soient bien motivés.","en":"Mr. ROOT maintained, firstly, that judgments by default were necessary, and secondly, that such judgments must contain a full statement of reasons.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0600.17","speaker_id":"root","certain":true,"name":"Elihu Root","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[600]}]}]},{"meeting":30,"section":"30","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0651.01","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. DE LAPRADELLE soumet la formule suivante:"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.02","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„La Cour, avant d'y faire droit, doit s'assurer que ces conclusions, reposant sur des preuves sérieuses, sont fondées en fait et en droit\"."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.03","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"LE PRESIDENT veut ajouter à cette formule entre les mots „sont\" et „fondées\" le mot „suffisamment\"."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.04","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Cette proposition, mise aux voix, est rejetée. La formule de M. de Lapradelle est adoptée."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.05","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.06","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté (avec des modifications rédactionnelles). La dernière partie du second alinéa est formulée comme suit: „La voix du président ou de celui qui le remplace est prépondérante.\""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.07","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.08","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté (avec modifications). Le président propose la formule suivante à remplacer la première partie du dernier alinéa:"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.09","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Les dissidents ont la faculté de demander que leurs oppositions ou leurs réserves soient constatées.\""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.10","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Sur la proposition de M. DE LAPRADELLE un vote préalable est pris sur les deux questions suivantes:"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.11","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"1. Le juge peut-il marquer son dissentiment sur le dispositif seulement?"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.12","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Cette question est répondue dans l'affirmative."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.13","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"2. Le juge peut-il marquer son dissentiment sur les motifs?"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.14","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Cette question est répondue dans la négative."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.15","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Le PRESIDENT lit de nouveau la formule qu'il a proposée avec une légère modification:"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.16","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Les dissidents ont la faculté de demander que leurs oppositions ou leurs réserves soient marquées\","},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.17","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 16."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.18","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Quand les agents, avocats et conseils ont fait valoir, sous le contrôle de la Cour, tous les moyens qu'ils jugent utiles, le Président prononce la clôture des débats."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.19","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour se retire en chambre du Conseil pour délibérer."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.20","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Les délibérations de la Cour sont et restent secrètes."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.21","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 17."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.22","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Les décisions de la Cour sont prises à la majorité des juges présents."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.23","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"En cas de partage de voix, la voix du Président ou de celui qui le remplace est prépondérante."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.24","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 18."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.25","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"L'arrêt est motivé. Il mentionne les noms des juges qui y ont pris part."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.26","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 19."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.27","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Si l'arrêt n'exprime pas, en tout ou en partie, l'opinion unanime des juges, les dissidents ont la faculté de demander l'insertion de leur opinion motivée, à la suite de l'exposé des motifs qui précède la décision de la majorité."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]},{"seg_id":"s0651.28","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":651,"printed":641,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Cette faculté n'est pas ouverte aux juges de la nationalité des parties."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[651]}]}]},{"meeting":31,"section":"31","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0666.01","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 22 bis."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.02","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"CHAPITRE III."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.03","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"En raison de la décision prise lors de la discussion de l'article 24 (voir ci-dessus), M. RICCI-BUSATTI propose de formuler ainsi le premier alinéa de l'article 22 bis :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.04","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„La Cour exerce normalement ses attributions...“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.05","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Alternativement M. RICCI-BUSATTI propose d'ajouter au commencement de cet alinéa :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.06","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Sauf le cas prévu à l'article 24, la Cour exerce...“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.07","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Sur la proposition de M. DE LAPRADELLE on se met d'accord pour ajouter au commencement de l'alinéa la formule suivante :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.08","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Sauf exception expressément prévue...“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.09","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Cette formule, mise au vote, est adoptée."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.10","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Le PRESIDENT ne prend pas part au vote."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.11","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Procédure."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.12","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 15."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.13","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Afin de donner satisfaction aux objections soulevées par M. HAGERUP lors de la discussion de l'article 29 No. 2, on se met d'accord pour insérer à l'alinéa 2 de l'article 15 les mots :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.14","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„non seulement que la compétence, mais...“ entre les mots „s'assurer“ et „que ces conclusions.“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.15","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. Hagerup a des objections contre la stipulation que „l'autre partie peut demander à la Cour... etc.“. Il faudrait stipuler que la Cour a le devoir de prendre une décision."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.16","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Il n'est pas donné satisfaction à cette observation."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.17","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 22."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.18","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La rédaction de l'alinéa 1er, laquelle avait été réservée, est complétée par l'addition des mots „et que la partie sans faute de sa part pouvait ne pas connaître.“"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.19","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Sauf exception expressément prévue, la Cour exerce ses attributions en séance plénière."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.20","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Si la présence de onze juges titulaires n'est pas assurée, ce nombre est parfait par l'entrée en fonction des juges suppléants."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.21","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Toutefois, si onze juges ne sont pas disponibles, le quorum de neuf sera suffisant pour constituer la Cour."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.22","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Lorsqu'une des parties ne se présente pas, ou s'abstient de faire valoir ses moyens, l'autre partie peut demander à la Cour de lui adjuger ses conclusions."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.23","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour, avant d'y faire droit, doit s'assurer non seulement qu'elle a compétence, mais que ces conclusions, reposant sur des preuves sérieuses, sont fondées en fait et en droit."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.24","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La révision de l'arrêt ne peut être éventuellement demandée à la Cour qu'à raison de la découverte d'un fait nouveau de nature à exercer une influence décisive et qui, avant le prononcé de l'arrêt, était inconnu de la Cour et de la partie qui demande la révision et que la partie, sans faute de sa…"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.25","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour peut subordonner l'ouverture de la procédure en révision à l'exécution préalable de l'arrêt."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]},{"seg_id":"s0666.26","meeting":31,"doc":"annex","pdf":666,"printed":656,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Aucune demande de révision ne peut être formée après l'expiration d'un délai de cinq ans."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-articles-12-15","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[666]}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":0},{